# head/adult/man/square: the man's Square head: flat jaw corners, a 6 px chin, a broader skull
# The slice (P2b wave 1, FOLK-BODY; to FACES in wave 2). Every head type keeps A3's eye rows and columns, the nose pixel
# and the mouth row (STYLE_P2 4), so expressions, marks and paint fit them all. Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body man
role head square
layer head
anchor head
keys rest

view D key rest origin -2 -3
mark face 1 5
